Playing a game the other day, I happened to be in a room with a
peaceful gremlin and a fountain.  After a while, the room was filled
with gremlins (and it really slowed the game down).  Since the little
monsters seem to obey the water rule, I was wondering:

o What happens if you throw a potion of water at one?

o What happens if you zap a wand of light at one?

o What happens if you throw a food ration at one (after midnight, of
  course)?

